          "at": 12.61
        }
      ],
      "end": 14.08
    },
    {
      "narration": "Compare four hundred and fifty six thousand, seven hundred and eighty two, with four hundred and fifty six thousand, seven hundred and twenty eight. Their hundred thousands, ten thousands, thousands and hundreds match. We have not found a difference yet, so keep moving right.",
      "heading": "Line up the places",
